@title: A query is matched where a word begins, so longer forms of it still match
STEP 1: A word and its longer forms
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/words.html
    CLICK the 'Product' link
    VERIFY that 'Opened the products' is present
    CLICK the 'Товар' link
    VERIFY that 'Відкрито товари' is present
    CLICK the 'Install' button
    VERIFY that 'Installed' is present
DONE.
